# Course certificate template of a ceramics school: the "certificate" example of stxt-pdf with Slots for each person
# and course. The frames, the school, the signature of its director and the seal are part of the template; the number
# of the certificate (in the margin, in the QR code and in the verification address), the person, the course with its
# hours, place, dates and grade, and the instructor with the image of their signature, which is optional, come in the
# data. certificate.json has the sample data.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Orientation: landscape
		Margin: 64 80 56 80
	Title: Certificate of Completion · ${course_short}
	Keywords: <keywords>
	Language: en
	Section:
		Page overlay:
			Id: paper
			Offset: -64 -80 -56 -80
			Layer: -3
			Box:
				Background: #FBF7EC
		Page overlay:
			Id: frame-outer
			Offset: -48 -62 -40 -62
			Layer: -2
			Box:
				Border: 5
				Border color: #14305E
		Page overlay:
			Id: frame-middle
			Offset: -38 -52 -30 -52
			Layer: -2
			Box:
				Border: 1.5
				Border color: #926829
		Page overlay:
			Id: frame-inner
			Offset: -32 -46 -24 -46
			Layer: -2
			Box:
				Border: 0.5
				Border color: #14305E
		Page overlay:
			Offset: -45 auto auto -59
			Layer: -1
			Block:
				Style: corner
		Page overlay:
			Offset: -45 -59 auto auto
			Layer: -1
			Block:
				Style: corner
		Page overlay:
			Offset: auto auto -37 -59
			Layer: -1
			Block:
				Style: corner
		Page overlay:
			Offset: auto -59 -37 auto
			Layer: -1
			Block:
				Style: corner
		Page overlay:
			Id: footer
			Offset: auto 0 -22 0
			Stack:
				Horizontal: center
				Vertical: center
				Gap: 8
				Item:
					Barcode: https://escuelaceramica.example/verificar/${number}
						Id: verification
						Alt: QR code to verify the certificate
						Box:
							Width: 48
						Typography:
							Color: #14305E
				Item:
					Text: Verifiable at escuelaceramica.example/verificar
						Link: https://escuelaceramica.example/verificar/${number}
		Page overlay:
			Id: serial
			Offset: 363.5 auto auto -31
			Rotate: -90
			Rotate origin: top left
			Box:
				Width: 260
			Text: Certificate no. ${number}
				Style: serial
		Text: Valle Ceramics School
			Style: school
		Heading 1:
			Text: Certificate of Completion
		Text: Presented to
			Style: aside
		Text: <recipient>
			Id: recipient
			Style: name
		Text: for having successfully completed the course
			Style: aside
		Heading 2:
			Text: <course>
		Text: A course of ${hours} class hours, held in ${place} from ${dates}, with a final grade of ${grade}.
			Box:
				Width: 500
				Margin: 0 auto 18 auto
		Stack:
			Id: signatures
			Horizontal: justify
			Vertical: bottom
			Item:
				Block:
					Box:
						Width: 220
					Image: examples/certificate/signature-director.svg
						Alt: Signature of the school director
						Box:
							Width: 140
							Margin: 0 auto
					Block:
						Style: line
						Text: Montserrat Puig Vila
							Typography:
								Bold: true
						Text: Director of the School
			Item:
				Block:
					Image: examples/certificate/en/seal.svg
						Id: seal
						Opacity: 85%
						Alt: Seal of excellence of the school
						Rotate: -8
						Box:
							Width: 100
			Item:
				Block: {instructor}
					Box:
						Width: 220
					Image: <?signature>
						Alt: Signature of the course instructor
						Box:
							Width: 140
							Margin: 0 auto
					Block:
						Style: line
						Text: <name>
							Typography:
								Bold: true
						Text: Course Instructor
